# Default behavior

- Small diffs. One task per change set.
- After edits: run `npm run lint` (and `npm run build` if the change is large).
- Say risks: auth, RLS, secrets, cron, edge deploy.
- DB change: add rollback note (how to undo migration or revert column).

# PR-ready checklist (before merge)

- [ ] Lint clean (`npm run lint`)
- [ ] Typecheck: `npx tsc --noEmit` if types touched
- [ ] Tests: run if `*.test.*` or `__tests__` exist for changed code
- [ ] Risk notes: what could break in prod
- [ ] Rollback note if DB or secrets changed

# Workflows (use with Cursor commands)

- Feature: `/ship` → `/review` (optional `/test`)
- Bug: `/fix` → `/review`
- DB: migrate locally → `/test` → `/review`

# MCP (when enabled)

- Supabase: check tool schema before SQL. Prefer read-only first.
- Browser: use for `/demo` and main flows after UI edits.

# Commands reference

- See `.cursor/commands/ship.md`, `fix.md`, `review.md`, `test.md`.
